Your mission is to design and build DIGITAL KABARIYA, a complete, scalable, production-oriented digital scrap collection and recycling marketplace for Pakistan.

This is not just a website, landing page, UI prototype or simple pickup booking application.

Build a complete business operating system that connects customers, collectors, businesses, warehouses, scrap dealers, wholesalers and recycling companies.

The platform should follow the simplicity and convenience of ScrapUncle's doorstep scrap collection business model while establishing its own unique identity, branding, technology, user experience and business operations.

Do not copy ScrapUncle's copyrighted assets, logo, source code or exact proprietary design.

