21. FINANCIAL MANAGEMENT AND PROFIT ENGINE
==================================================

For every pickup, calculate:

- Scrap buying cost
- Customer payout
- Collector commission
- Fuel allocation
- Transportation
- Sorting cost
- Other direct cost
- Expected selling value
- Actual selling value
- Gross margin
- Contribution margin

Formulas:

Gross Margin =
Actual Selling Value - Scrap Purchase Cost.

Contribution Margin =
Gross Margin - Direct Collection and Processing Costs.

Net Operating Profit =
Contribution Margin - Operating Expenses.

Provide profitability reports by:

- Pickup
- Material
- Collector
- Zone
- Warehouse
